# OCaml LSP / merlin configuration for math-coding 3.0-alpha.
#
# Hand-written, not dune-generated, because the nixpkgs revision
# pinned in flake.nix (e94cb15, 2025-Q3) ships dune 3.23.1 with
# the `(using merlin-conf 0.1)` stanza REMOVED — every variant
# tried (0.0, 0.1, dune-merlin, ocaml-lsp-server) errors with
# `Unknown extension "..."`. Until the dev shell moves to a nixpkgs
# that has merlin-conf re-introduced, the hand-written .merlin is
# the only path. See decisions/merlin-lsp-2026-10.yaml for the
# reversal signal `nixpkgs-merlin-conf-available` that flips back
# to dune-generated.
#
# Verified with:
#   - ocaml-lsp 1.27.0 (LSP server, supersedes merlin's protocol
#     layer; reads .merlin via dot-merlin-reader).
#   - merlin 5.8-505 (raw merlin, used for editor-independent
#     type queries; reads .merlin directly).
#
# Conventions used here mirror the dune layout of the project
# (lib/ is the kernel with wrapped-false layout, lib/{attestations,
# git,junit} are sub-libraries, bin/ is the mathc executable,
# tests/ is the Alcotest + QCheck suite):

# --- kernel -----------------------------------------------------------------
S lib
S lib/attestations
S lib/git
S lib/junit
B _build/default/lib
B _build/default/lib/attestations
B _build/default/lib/git
B _build/default/lib/junit

# --- CLI --------------------------------------------------------------------
S bin
B _build/default/bin

# --- tests ------------------------------------------------------------------
S tests
B _build/default/tests

# --- package dependencies ----------------------------------------------------
PKG str
PKG alcotest qcheck qcheck-core